cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, cite it as below (CC BY 4.0 — attribution with a link to agiscorecard.com satisfies the license)."
title: "The AGI Scorecard: Situational Awareness predictions, graded"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "The AGI Scorecard"
    website: "https://agiscorecard.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/f-tiger/agiscorecard-mcp"
url: "https://agiscorecard.com/data.json"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Every prediction in Leopold Aschenbrenner's "Situational Awareness" (June 2024),
  graded against public evidence with pre-registered flip conditions, plus the
  AGI-2027 Thesis Tracker — one auditable 0-100 score recomputed from the verdicts.
  This repository mirrors the live dataset; the source of truth is agiscorecard.com.
  The dataset is living: cite the URL together with the dateModified field of the
  copy you used (no DOI is registered).
